{"text":"I submitted an abstract to the MHSRS, I think it's Military Health Symposi um the Military Health System Research Symposium. Um it basically goes over this project that we were working on as part of a grant from Tatrick which is like a research um like organization within the um within MTech so Tatric is telemedicine and advanced research technology center um uh they gave us a grant the press release I'm uh providing a link to below um and essentially we built out this um app um that has support for all of these different sensors and we like send the sensors over to the um we send the sensors over to the military they're evaluating it um and yeah that's basically the gist of it um I've basically just taken out all the content from the text abstract and put it into the poster um but I need some help figuring out con the rest of the content because you can see my like capability description section of the abstract is pretty sparse I think I can like expand it a little restructure it so it takes up more space and maybe covers a bit a little bit more detail about the app but yeah um or maybe I could expand the method section a little and move the cap like reduce the space for the capability description and then have the methods on the left side and move applicability to medical roles of care to the top right um and then I also want your help figuring out what figures to include right now I have a schematic for the system I want to include the like actual screenshots of the app um and then we also have some pictures of like the complete sensor suite kits that we actually shipped out to Tatric and I think it I think it would be nice to also include some of those in the thing we s in like inside of that big box in the center for results. But for now I guess let's start and I'm attaching one of such images. We have more we can pick exactly which ones we want to include a little later. But for now I just want your help figuring out what to do about the content and space utilization, particularly like for the left and right columns. The middle column is just going to be mostly images and we'll populate that accordingly. So can I just get your input on what you think how you think I can structure the poster a little better to take more advantage of the space? And if it's the method section or capability discipl uh description section you think I should expand and what additional content you think would be relevant to the audience at this conference."}